!!! A statement ends at end of line. A period or a semicolon ends one
!!! explicitly. Periods are accepted because a model writing prose-shaped
!!! code ends sentences with them, and a period between names is still
!!! member access.
area demo.prose

reading begin record
    field sensor as number
    field level as number
end record

main returns number begin function
    value sample is build reading with sensor being 1, level being 42.
    say sample.sensor.
    say sample.level.

    set a-total to 0; set a-total to a-total plus 1.
    say "done".

    value ratio as floating is 0.5.
    say ratio.

    give 0.
end function
